            "review_text": "Camper20769806619\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nFantastic food, incredible dipping sauce, and great service!\nSep 2026 • Friends\nI had a wonderful dining experience at Chụm. The boiled pork rolls were fresh, tender, and paired perfectly with a generous variety of crisp greens. The highlight for me was definitely the signature dipping sauce-rich, flavorful, well-balanced, and absolutely delicious. The staff were attentive, polite, and quick to assist throughout the meal despite the place being busy. Highly recommended for anyone craving authentic Vietnamese rolls!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nMust try the signature pork rolls with fermented dipping sauce! Come before 7 PM or reserve ahead on weekends.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 3, 2026",
